### Static method: `AbortSignal.abort([reason])`



* `reason` {any}
* Returns: {AbortSignal}

Returns a new already aborted `AbortSignal`.

### `abortSignal.aborted`



* Type: {boolean}

True after the `AbortController` has been aborted.

### `abortSignal.reason`



* Type: {any}

An optional reason specified when the `AbortSignal` was triggered.

